        },
        "quote": "(a) Intent. The intent of these site plan regulations is to promote orderly growth and development in the City of Topeka and unincorporated Shawnee County; to ensure that development is done in a manner harmonious with surrounding properties, consistent with the general public welfare and with the policies in the comprehensive metropolitan plan; and the requirements of the comprehensive zoning regulations.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.260.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
