          "start": 1096
        },
        "quote": "(1) The project’s compatibility with its environment and with other land uses and buildings in the surrounding area, including historic structures and landmarks and the character of proposed open space and landscape improvements.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.260.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
